## Durable decisions

The durable **"why"** record for the whole project: decisions that outlive any one campaign — data
conventions, shared-artifact choices, tooling / environment calls, cross-campaign methodology.
Losing this rationale on a copy or fork is what causes work to be repeated; keep it here so it
survives. (Campaign-scoped decisions live in that campaign's `campaign.md` §Decision record.)

Each entry: the decision, the alternatives, why this one, the conditions it rests on, and what
would make you revisit it (mirrors the `record-decision` skill). Append-only: never rewrite a
closed entry; supersede it and link the two.

